OL,3,AHealey to promise #15m to tackle
OL,4,Amisogyny in Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey has pledged to
OL,7,Fgive #15m to a fund established to
OL,8,Ftackle misogyny in schools, at work and
OL,9,Fin communities.
OL,11,FThe government said the money will be
OL,12,Fprovided over three years to schemes
OL,13,Fsuch as mentoring for young people,
OL,14,Fworkplace training and communications
OL,15,Fcampaigns designed to improve women and
OL,16,Fgirls' safety.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
