OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHealey to promise #15m to tackle
OL,4,Amisogyny in Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on the eve of his first
OL,7,FBudget, Healey said: "Every woman and
OL,8,Fgirl deserves to feel safe, respected
OL,9,Fand able to pursue their ambitions - at
OL,10,Fschool, at work and in their
OL,11,Fcommunities."
OL,13,FBut Conservative shadow women and
OL,14,Fequalities minister Joy Morrissey said
OL,15,F"not a single woman and girl is going
OL,16,Fto feel safer with this total waste of
OL,17,Fpublic money".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
